      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "## Across the federation\n\nThe same question, asked of every wiki the registry knows, a batch of a hundred sites at a time, nearest sites first \u2014 it starts by itself. Results already shown stay where they are while batches land; anything that ranks above them is announced and folded in when you ask; a result you open is marked and keeps its place; and the list is remembered, so coming back here shows it at once and carries on.",
